WEBVTT

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.610
Kuraki will marry Yuki and marry into the Kaionji family.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.740
Along with that, he'll be appointed as the vice-chairman of the group.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.130
Hold on, Father.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:27.790
Kuraki.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.130
Pardon me.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:40.760
Shouldn't you choose one of our siblings to be the vice-chairman?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.560
I don't recall saying it'd be one of you.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.270
I only said that I'd choose one of my children.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.480
He'll be my son-in-law once he marries Yuki.

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
"Breach"

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.670
It's about Ibuki Keita.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.250
He woke up during our attack on the Japanese Branch of the Noble One a few days ago.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.090
After that, the whereabouts of him and his friends remain unknown.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.090
Continue your search for him.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:17.220
Roger.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.060
You can't change anything no matter what you do.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:27.640
If, despite that, you unyieldingly continue to struggle, I'd enjoy such a reunion between the two of us.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:46.660
It looks like Kaionji's troops haven't extended their search to our location.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.250
But it's just a matter of time, isn't it?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.840
Practically every area is under Kaionji's surveillance.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:59.340
And to think that the situation has become this bad while I was in a coma for half a year...

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.760
Damn that Sawamura.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.930
Hey, is Akane-san really...

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.350
Sawamura has most likely taken her hostage.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.360
I'm such an idiot for believing Sawamura.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.780
Keita, don't blame yourself.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:30.830
Princess.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.840
What's wrong, Yakumo?

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:37.840
Are you troubled by something?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.930
Nothing is really troubling me.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:47.060
You're over thinking it if you think what's happening now is your fault.

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:51.230
You've been doing your best with everything.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:58.280
Was there a point in leaving the pure lands?

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:04.450
Brother died... without telling me what I wanted to know.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:11.370
Even so, I thought it would be fine if there was peace in the world.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.710
However, we weren't able to correct the disruption in the balance,

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.630
and the world was thrown into an even worse state of chaos.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.760
Just what should I do from now on?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.640
At the very least, I want to protect Keita-san and Akane-san.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:34.230
But, if I fight, I will be shaving away Keita-san's life.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:53.290
You want to eat this?

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.630
How long am I going to remain here?

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.890
This isn't what I desired.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.190
Reishin, just what should I do?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.500
Yes?

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.880
You got tricked, Yuki.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.420
Sis?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.420
You were completely used by Kuraki.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.680
You intended to use him, yet he used you.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.930
But that can't be helped since you're a Sub.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.430
Did you make this call just to criticize me?

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.690
Stop being so stubborn.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:01.440
Isn't this the time for us siblings to work together?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.950
We can't let that man do whatever he wants to Kaionji.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.450
I know that he is threatening you with your Root.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.290
But don't worry.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.710
We've managed to track down her location.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.130
She's in the VIP room at the Kaionji Hotel.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.710
Really?

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.670
Shall we meet tonight?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.720
Let's discuss what to do from now on.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:34.430
We, as your siblings, will definitely protect you.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:40.900
Don't worry, with you as the exception, we're all Master Roots.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:03.250
Sis, thanks for helping me.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.630
You are pretty humble toward your siblings.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.850
How...?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:17.520
I've just talked to your siblings, and we've reached an agreement.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.480
It's great that they're wise.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:25.110
They are able to put personal feelings aside and calmly consider the advantages and disadvantages.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.280
They sent you their best regards.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.160
Kill me if you want to!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.450
Why don't you just replace me with my Root?

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:37.790
What you need is a woman who is the daughter of the Kaionji Group, right?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:41.170
There shouldn't be any problems since we look the same!

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.290
Just how lazy can you get?

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.670
Lazy?

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.430
Be it your current position or searching for your root and going against me,

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.300
you rely on other people's power to help you.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:58.600
You go as far as letting others determine whether you live or die?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.810
How dare you say that.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:06.190
I really hate people like you.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.450
Isn't it time for you to notice it?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.870
You can't do anything by yourself.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.460
You'll just continue being used while intending to use others.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.970
That isn't true!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.340
Reishin... Only Reishin is...

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:38.720
Reishin-sama was just making use of you too.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.690
You didn't even realize that?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.900
What a lazy and foolish spoiled brat.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:51.240
Merely sitting there and lamenting your life as a Sub suits you very well.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:57.740
Fate will eventually come to kill you.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:07.000
Or perhaps, you will, at the very least, choose your own end.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:24.770
I've decided.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.770
I'll go to the Kaionji Building to meet Sawamura.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.280
Please wait, Keita-san!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.910
Kaionji is much stronger than before.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.660
Not only do they have squads of contractees and Mototsumitama,

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.160
they also have an alliance with the Noble One too.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:44.410
Even so, we need to go there in order to save Akane-san, right?

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.710
Are you planning on heading toward your death?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.170
You're not going to defeat them without a plan.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.970
There's an appropriate time to fight.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:09:01.060
The appropriate time is even more crucial when you're up against a powerful enemy.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:08.360
Will you fight if that time has arrived?

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.820
I'll fight.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.820
The chance is here.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.660
They are holding a party for the appointment of the vice-chairman.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.320
We intend to attend it.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.200
Is this for real?!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.460
Steiner would have definitely done the same if he were alive.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:38.720
It should be a magnificent sight to see Master Roots from both the political and economic worlds gather here.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.970
General Gustav, we are honored to have you here.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.480
With this, the Kaionji Group has nothing else to worry about.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.640
Yes.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:52.820
Kuraki is the most suitable man to become the leader of the nearing future that will be managed by Master Roots.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.360
Go and rest if you're feeling upset about this.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.410
But...

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.700
It'll be okay.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.490
It doesn't matter if you're here or not.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.160
Kuraki, come here.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.040
Okay.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:12.500
President Howard, allow me to introduce you to this young man.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.170
This is Kuraki, soon to be my son-in-law.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.510
Oh, so you're the one?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:23.390
It's so refreshing to see no Subs around.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:28.520
I wish I was a guest here rather than a security guard.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.020
What's wrong?

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:35.900
Pardon me.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.030
Please show me your invitation card.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.030
I don't have one.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.030
Miss Yuki, you're a Sub?

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.620
So, the rumor that Yuki-sama is a Sub is true?

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.590
Today is to celebrate both the appointment of Kuraki Daichi,

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:07.560
henceforth known as Kaionji Daichi, as vice-chairman, as well as his marriage engagement.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.520
Thank you all for coming.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.190
It has started.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.030
I didn't notice anything out of the ordinary.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.610
Continue your surveillance.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.570
Roger.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:29.700
To have the Noble One guard their party... Those monkeys from the far east are such cowards.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.210
Let's go.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.720
What's wrong, Punipuni?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.730
So soon?!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.240
We've been waiting for you, Colonel Bernhard.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:10.750
I'm Kaionji Daichi, the man appointed to become the vice-chairman.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:18.250
Everyone gathered here is a Master Root.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:23.260
In other words, they are the people who will shape the future of Japan and even the world.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:27.260
However, I hope that you won't forget something.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.680
Many Subs were sacrificed in order to create us Master Roots.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:39.940
The future we aim for is one where people, regardless of whether they are Roots or Subs, can live happily together.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:45.780
In order to do that, we need Master Roots who possess both the luck and the abilities to lead us there.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.780
I'm a... Sub...

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:54.500
Fate made us Roots and eventually, Master Roots.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.670
Even though fate was the one who took the lives away from our Subs,

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:03.970
they were precious lives needed in order to lay down the foundation for the future.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.630
If I'm going to be killed by fate...

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.550
Fate has entrusted the future to us.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.560
I swear that I'll remember that,

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:16.560
and keep it within my heart as I craft out the ideal future!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.440
I'll at least end it myself.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.820
Stop saying such selfish things!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:37.080
Do you think you can be forgiven for killing those Subs just by saying those nice words?

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.710
Hey, it's a Sub.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:49.010
Everyone, sorry for the surprise.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:53.100
He's an old friend of mine, Ibuki Keita-kun.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:59.100
Even though he's a Sub, he refuses to bow down to fate. A man worth admiring.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.940
What do you intend to do, Sawamura!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:09.070
You artificially produce Master Roots by making use of the Doppeliner system.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:13.580
Do you intend to destroy the world by disrupting the balance of coexistence?!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:20.880
Not to mention that you've killed countless Subs in your quest for the power of luck!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.670
It's all done to create a better future.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.630
I'll even use fate in order to do that.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:32.010
I'm going to crush that kind of fate!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.140
Crush... fate?

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.100
What happened?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.290
What is going on?

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.250
Don't worry, I'll deal with it now.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.380
Where's Akane-san?

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.220
You're doing all this for a woman?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.890
W-What's happening?

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.640
What are the guards doing?!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.020
General Gustav.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:28.900
I hope you understand that a lot of people can't agree with your orders.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.530
Bernhard...

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:36.910
Remember that we, Mototsumitama, are tasked with protecting the balance of coexistence.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:45.000
There exists a world that you people from the German High Council, who only think about fighting, cannot understand

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.130
Are you advising me?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.340
It's still ten thousand years too soon for that.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.930
This saves us time in hunting down you traitors.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.890
Eliminate all of them.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.050
Roger.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:57.930
Fine.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:01.230
I'll show you the will of those who can only fight.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.690
Return Akane-san to me.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:08.440
Ibuki, I'm surprised that you're such an idiot.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:14.070
Kuraki-sama! Someone is trespassing in the VIP floor!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.450
Impossible...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.160
So that's where Akane-san is?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.990
Stop them!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.880
Ibuki, my Mototsumitama is strong.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.220
He even defeated Reishin.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:34.470
What?

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.220
Sawamura, stop!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.720
I'm your opponent.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.970
Kuro, it's time to perform synchro.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.610
Kuro!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:48.980
O-Okay!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.860
Synchro!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.870
This flow of Tera... feels so nostalgic.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.710
Yakumo, let's head over to where Kuro-chan and the others are.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:10.630
Okay.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.890
Bernhard!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.720
Exceed, Dreadful Storm!

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.440
They aren't here.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.440
Let's head back.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.480
Please wait.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.280
I sense the presence of a Mototsumitama in there.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.200
Your defense is too weak!

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.410
What's wrong, Kuro?!

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.670
Don't be careless!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.670
Okay!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.220
Kuro, Exceed!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:57.970
Okay!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.430
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.610
Kuro!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.270
What are you doing?

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.200
What just happened?

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.410
Bernhard-san!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.250
Leave this place to us.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.630
Let's go, Kuro.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:33.750
Okay.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.510
Damn it!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.010
Why can't it be opened?

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.850
Is anyone around?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.690
You're... Kaionji Yuki-san...

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:54.980
That's right.

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:58.490
Hey, do you know a boy called Ibuki?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.610
Keita-kun?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.490
Did you see Keita-kun?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.080
He's in the hotel right now.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:09.910
He's still alive...

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.340
Keita-kun... is still alive...

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.840
But you're going to die here.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.390
Sano Akane, you're my Root.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.560
I'm your Root?

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.350
You're mistaken. Kuraki-san told me that you're my Root-

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:30.640
Kuraki was lying to you.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.810
Lying?

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.650
You're the Root and I'm the Sub.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.980
That's the truth.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.530
Impossible...

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.440
Unfortunately, we've met.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.490
In other words, if nothing is done, I'll die since I'm a Sub.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.910
You, who survived, will become a Master Root.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:50.250
You'll absorb my luck and become blessed.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.120
You alone will become blessed.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.170
I want to become a daughter worthy of the Kaionji name.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.720
That's why I'll kill you and survive.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.260
Minus... Root...

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:04.800
That's right.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.760
An existence that goes against the rules and balance of the world.

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:10.600
Even so, I'll survive.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.310
I'll try to survive even if it means going against fate!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.190
This is the end.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:18.190
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:36.380
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:36.380
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:47.800
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:47.800
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:48.140 --> 00:21:00.190
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:48.140 --> 00:21:00.190
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:16.580
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:16.580
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:19.790
I'm heading in.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:21.170
Okay.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.050
What's with this room?

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.060
It's been a while, Yakumo.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:37.900
"Carnage"

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:36.060
The Princess is here too, right?

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.810
S-Shinra...
